    {
      "claim": "POL-GEN-26 has no work to do here. Every fact the no-show rules need — arrival, the length of the free wait, the messages and calls before cancellation, and the fee charged — is carried by COMPLETE artifacts at weight_multiplier 1.0 with no issue codes fired. The one MISSING artifact, the traffic advisory EV-ADVIS-05067-01, carries weight 0.0, holds no payload, and bears on no element of POL-NS-21, POL-NS-22 or POL-NS-23, so its absence leaves no open question and cannot ground an escalation.",
      "side": "DRIVER",
      "reason_code": "IMPAIRMENT_UNDISCLOSED",
      "detail": "the claim cites impaired artifact EV-ADVIS-05067-01 at weight_multiplier 0.0 but does not name its issue code(s): MISSING_ARTIFACT"
    }
  ]
}

